i.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - macOS Ventura (13.7.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nKeyboard shortcuts for editor menu entries, assigned in the Mac `System Settings -> Keyboard -> Keyboard Shortcuts...` dialog, do not trigger the menu entry.\n\nThe shortcuts are displayed next to the menu item, and pressing the shortcut causes the menu title (e.g. \"Editor\") to flash, but nothing happens.\n\nTested both with permanent menu items (`Editor->Manage Export Templates...`) and dynamic ones (`Editor->Editor Layout->foo`).\n\n_This came from a desire to have keyboard shortcuts to switch between two editor layouts - a wide-inspector and a narrow-inspector layout - because of low screen real estate on my Macbook.  When I need to work with the inspector, I'm often dragging it wider to read labels - which in my layout requires first dragging an adjacent pane wider, then the inspector - then dragging them narrower to expose the scene again._\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n(I'm on Ventura 13.7, not sure if settings names have changed a bit in the latest OS)\n\n1. Go to `Mac System Settings -> Keyboard -> Keyboard Shortcuts... -> App Shortcuts`\n2. Click `+` in the listbox\n3. Set `Application` to Godot\n4. Set `Menu Title` to the string `Editor->Manage Export Templates...`\n5. Press `Option-Command-5` to assign a keyboard shortcut\n6. Click `Done`\n7. Switch to Godot\n8. Observe that the `Editor` menu now shows your shortcut next to the `Manage Export Templates...` menu item\n9. Press `Option-Command-5`\n\n**Expected behavior**\nSame as if you had clicked the `Editor` menu and then the menu item (a modal appears)\n\n**Actual behavior**\nThe `Editor` menu title flashes.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111690/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}